# CONTOH request untuk dicoba lokal. Ganti token setelah login. Jangan commit token asli.
@base = http://localhost:5000/api/
@contentType = application/json
@AccessToken = PASTE_TOKEN_DISINI_SETELAH_LOGIN

### Lihat review satu resep (publik)
GET {{base}}reviews/recipe/1?page=1&limit=10

### Ringkasan rating satu resep (publik)
GET {{base}}reviews/recipe/1/summary

### Review milik sendiri (login)
GET {{base}}reviews/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Buat review (login, rating 1-5)
POST {{base}}reviews/recipe/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "Enak banget, bumbunya pas!"
}

### Ubah review milik sendiri (login)
PATCH {{base}}reviews/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
    "rating": 4,
    "comment": "Update: setelah coba lagi, rasanya pas."
}

### Hapus review (pemilik atau admin)
DELETE {{base}}reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
